<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Dries declares 75 cts interim div.</title>
<headline>Dries declares 75 cts interim div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Type of share: ordinary</p>
<p>Period: interim</p>
<p>Amount: 75.0 cents</p>
<p>Pay date: February 5</p>
<p>Record date: December 27</p>
<p>Full name: Driefontein Consolidated Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is part of the Gold Fields of South Africa Ltd group.  Gold Fields said Deelkraal Gold Mining Co had not declared an interim dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
